  ok: rho*(q,k) = 1/2 for q = 5, 7 and k = 2, 3, 4 (exhaustive, exact Karp)
  ok: Theorem N: rho_max >= log_(q+1) 2 on 260 random strategies (q = 5..13, k = 3..7)
